# Environment

Copy `.env.example` to `.env.local` for local development.

| Variable | Description | Default |
|----------|-------------|---------|
| `DATABASE_URL` | PostgreSQL connection string | — (optional, demo mode without) |
| `DEMO_MODE` | Force in-memory demo data | `true` if unset |
| `AUTH_SECRET` | JWT signing secret (min 32 chars) | dev fallback |
| `AUTH_PROVIDER` | `jwt` or `supabase` | `jwt` |
| `SUPABASE_URL` | Supabase project URL | — |
| `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` | Supabase anon key | — |
| `AI_PROVIDER` | `mock` or `openai` | `mock` |
| `OPENAI_API_KEY` | OpenAI API key | — |
| `PARTNER_API_KEYS` | Clés API partenaires (`key:PartnerName,...`) | clé démo incluse |
| `EMAIL_PROVIDER` | `mock` or `resend` | `mock` |
| `RESEND_API_KEY` | Clé Resend pour emails transactionnels | — |
| `EMAIL_FROM` | Expéditeur email | `noreply@darbladi.demo` |
| `CRON_SECRET` | Secret pour `/api/v1/cron/alerts` | — |
| `PAYMENT_PROVIDER` | `mock` or `stripe` | `mock` |
| `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` | Clé Stripe pour paiements réels | — |
| `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` | Secret webhook Stripe | — |
| `STORAGE_PROVIDER` | `mock` or `supabase` | `mock` |
| `SUPABASE_STORAGE_BUCKET` | Bucket médias | `listings` |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL` | URL publique (sitemap, API) | `http://localhost:3000` |

## Production

Set `DEMO_MODE=false` and configure `DATABASE_URL` to persist data in PostgreSQL.

Run migrations:

```bash
pnpm db:push
pnpm db:seed
```

Apply RLS policies (Supabase):

```bash
psql $DATABASE_URL -f supabase/migrations/001_rls.sql
```
